'''Sludge''' is an [[NPC]] found in the {{zone|Jungle}} of the [[Crystal Hollows]] inside a small wooden structure. After hitting them {{Green|5}} times, they reward the player with a chest of loot, containing [[Crystal Hollows#Treasure|normal loot]] and high levels of [[Gemstone Powder]].

